      "Use LessonExperience contract_version 3.0 in the future candidate.",
      "Leave candidate_revision undecided until the candidate phase.",
      "Use relevance and intelligibility as the future qualitative production review dimensions through human or external review; automatic evaluation must not accredit them.",
      "Keep comprehension, own production and transfer evidence structurally separable in the future candidate.",
      "Experience completion must not imply Skill mastery, retention or curricular progress.",
      "Do not create or activate a candidate, loader, admission, publication, membership, frontend or B181 work from this specification."
    ],
    "acceptance_criteria": [
      "The specification contains exactly one Skill, a1_express_immediate_need_orally, and that Skill represents only the approved observable oral capability.",
      "The learner outcome requires an own oral I need + noun production for a clear visual and auditory situation and transfer to a different nearby need with strictly less support.",
      "The productive language is limited to I need + noun with water, help and food.",
      "Functional pronunciation prioritizes intelligibility, short-block fluency, comprehensible I and need, and natural linking without requiring phonetic perfection or an independent phoneme Skill.",
      "The future experience provides exposure, instruction, practice, own production, evidence and transfer while keeping comprehension as preparation rather than mastery.",
